t took a lot of strength  but it just felt right logically and  made no sense you know you look at this  from the outside my friends look at it's  like you're what are you doing you're  crazy how could you turn down this  opportunity there's nothing happening  with your your company what are you  doing and I had to listen to my heart it  just felt like I needed to do this like  I would find a way I had to at least try  did not want to live the rest of my life  wondering what if what if I just stuck  with it and I'm so glad and so grateful  that I didn't go the job route and it  was hard and I suffered and I doubt it  myself and and faced some of the most  you know terrifying and painful  situations in my life getting that  business off the ground but it did work  out and now i have my friends coming  back to me who are graduated school with  and they're saying you know what i hate  my job i'm working 80 to 100 hours a  week I can't do this anymore you know I  never see my my wife or my husband I'm  thinking of starting my own business and  I look at them and I'm like oh my i'm so  glad that i didn't go that route if you  look at when people are dying  the number one thing that they say if  they said I wish my life was different  what do you wish and the number one  thing they say is I wish I taken more  chances I don't want that to be you I  don't want that to be me I don't want to  sit back when I'm on my death bed  looking back in my life and said this  was nothing I didn't I wish I'd taken  more risk-taking more chances believed  in myself more so you're on an  interesting point Martin where you are  right now you know seventeen just  graduating you have the whole wall in  front of you I'm sure you're getting  lots of opinions from people on what to  do the best advice that I can give you  is even though it's scary even though  you don't know how it's going to work  out even though you don't see any  opportunities to make money at it right  now listen to your heart and you'll find  your path believe those are you watching  like the video give it a thumbs up below  let me know what you think leave a  comment underneath you have a question  leave a comment I'll make a video  response and subscribe to the channel if  you want to see more videos like this  thank you so much and I'll see you soon
 

